Reconstructed Modules:
- webrtc-signaling: Pure Go backend signaling, persistence, and WebSocket hub
- cloudphone-agent: Native Go agent bridge for Android (WebRTC + Scrcpy server)
- android-helper: Android Java display/audio encoder and input injection daemon (libsys_core.so)
- android-app: Android Kotlin management host app & controller client

